id: full-power-super-saiyan-full-power-of-the-super-saiyan
name: Full Power of the Super Saiyan
order: 2
slot: trait
description: >
  Unleashing the unlimited potential of the Super Saiyan Transformation, you draw out even more raw power.
text: >
  Full Power of the Super Saiyan: Unleashing the unlimited potential of the Super Saiyan Transformation, you draw out even more raw power.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Dice Score of your Duel Clashes by 1(T) for every 4 stacks of Battle Born you possess (max. 3(T)).
  (2)-[Passive]: For every 4 stacks of Battle Born you possess, increase your Tier of Power Extra Dice by 1 Category (max. +3 Categories).
  (3)-[Triggered]: If you are hit by an Attacking Maneuver, you may increase your Damage Reduction by 1(T) for every 2 stacks of Battle Born you possess for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver. After concluding that Maneuver, lose 1 stack of Battle Born.
  (4)-[Triggered]: If you hit an Opponent with an Attacking Maneuver, you may increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T) for every 2 stacks of Battle Born you possess for the duration of that Attacking Maneuver. After concluding that Maneuver, lose 1 stack of Battle Born.
  (5)-[Triggered/Transform, 1/Encounter]: Enter the Raging State until the end of your turn.

---

# (1) Duel Clashes 1(T) for every 4 stacks of Battle Born (max. 3(T)).
[passive, effect 1]
clash.duel += min(3, floor((battlebornstrike.stacks + battleborndodge.stacks + battlebornwound.stacks) / 4)) * 1(T);

# (2) The Tier of Power Extra Dice a Category for every 4 stacks of Battle Born (max. 3).
[passive, effect 2]
dice.extra.category += min(3, floor((battlebornstrike.stacks + battleborndodge.stacks + battlebornwound.stacks) / 4));

# (3) Hit: Damage Reduction, (4) hitting: the Wound, 1(T) for every 2 stacks of Battle Born - asked, a stack lost once the attack is over
# (chat.mjs battleBornAsked).
[passive, effect 3]
allow battleBorn.reduction;

[passive, effect 4]
allow battleBorn.wound;

# (5) Entering it, once an Encounter: Raging till the end of your turn - or Superior, where Deeper into the Depths (4) offers it.
[triggered/transform, 1/encounter, effect 5]
ragingOrSuperior();
